docs {
  # Authentication Info
  
  Returns information about authentication endpoints.
  
  Note: Monolenz uses Supabase for authentication. All login/register/logout
  operations should be performed directly through the Supabase client.
  
  ## Response Example
  ```json
  {
    "message": "Authentication endpoints",
    "note": "Using Supabase for authentication",
    "endpoints": {
      "login": "Use Supabase client",
      "register": "Use Supabase client",
      "logout": "Use Supabase client"
    }
  }
  ```
}
